{"text": "Gulls flew near the boat or sat on the water like ducks, and they stared at the men with black, bead like eyes. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> One gull came down and tried to land on the captains head, but he did not dare to strike at it with the heavy rope. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Any sudden movement could have turned the boat over, so the captain gently waved the bird away with his hand. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The oiler and the correspondent took turns at the oars, and changing seats in that small boat was harder than stealing eggs from under a hen. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> So carefully did they move that the boat hardly rocked, and each man rowed until his back and arms ached. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> Late in the morning the captain, raising himself in the bow, said that he could see the lighthouse at Mosquito Inlet. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> The correspondent, who was rowing, had to turn his head many times before he finally found the tiny thing on the horizon. <break time=\"0.8s\" /> It looked like the point of a pin, and yet it showed the men that land was really out there.", "alignment": {"characters": ["G", "u", "l", "l", "s", " ", "f", "l", "e", "w", " ", "n", "e", "a", "r", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "b", "o", "a", "t", " ", "o", "r", " ", "s", "a", "t", " ", "o", "n", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "w", "a", "t", "e", "r", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "d", "u", "c", "k", "s", ",", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "h", "e", "y", " ", "s", "t", "a", "r", "e", "d", " ", "a", "t", " ", "t", "h", "e", " ", "m", "e", "n", " ", "w", "i", "t", "h", " ", "b", "l", "a", "c", "k", ",", " ", "b", "e", "a", "d", " ", "l", "i", "k", "e", " ", "e", "y", "e", "s", ".", " ", "<", "b", "r", "e", "a", "k", " ", "t", "i", "m", "e", "=", "\"", "0", ".", "8", "s", "\"", " ", "/", ">", " ", "O", "n", "e", " ", "g", "u", "l", "l", " ", "c", "a", "m", "e", " ", "d", "o", "w", "n", " ", "a", "n", "d", " ", "t", "r", "i", "e", "d", " ", "t", "o", " ", "l", "a", "n", "d", " ", "o", "n", " ", 